{"card":{"card_id":"ma-c-5aca7eb164f0cd528586","statement":"Now let $f: F_1\\to F_2$ be an $A$-bimodule map. Suppose $F_i$ admits a left dual $G_i$. Let\n\n\\[\ng: G_2\\xrightarrow{u_{F_1}\\otimes \\id_{G_2}} G_1\\otimes_A F_1\\otimes_A G_2\\xrightarrow{\\id_{G_1}\\otimes f\\otimes \\id_{G_2}} G_1\\otimes_AF_2\\otimes_AG_2\\xrightarrow{\\id_{G_1}\\otimes e_{F_2}}G_1\n\\]\n\nbe the (left) dual of $f$.\nThen under the duality from <<ref:lem-dualizability-of-categorical-trace>>, the dual of $\\tr(A,f): \\tr(A,F_1)\\to \\tr(A,F_2)$ is given by $\\tr(A, g): \\tr(A,G_2)\\to \\tr(A,G_1)$.","source_id":"arXiv:2504.07482","cluster":"representation_theory","statement_sha256":"6d853537c2b835a54003aea9f32515988274597b85ebf5e5fb53a666619122f6","kind":"lemma","label":"Lemma 508","ref_key":"lem: trace dual morphism vs dual morphism trace","name":"","order":726,"deps":[{"ref":"lem-dualizability-of-categorical-trace","card_id":"ma-c-46ac819a82e526e68448","label":"Lemma 507","resolved":true,"target":"card"}],"cite_keys":[],"provenance":{"source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.07482","harvest_mode":"arxiv_eprint","payload_sha256":"1b700e8c4a2fc6f0c0f522039f223820ba6737a9a0ac91aea37c58ba7a3389c2","line":14360,"origin":"latex_env","retrieved_at":"2026-09-28T11:10:54+08:00"},"wash":{"version":"cardwash.v2","stages":["segment","purify","classify","dedupe","emit"],"numbering":"document_order_with_label_heuristic","detail":{"stripped_proof":false,"chars":495,"math_hints":44}}},"paper":{"source_id":"arXiv:2504.07482","title":"Tame categorical local Langlands correspondence","abstract":"In one of our previous articles, we outlined the formulation of a version of the categorical arithmetic local Langlands conjecture. The aims of this article are threefold. First, we provide a detailed account of one component of this conjecture: the local Langlands category. Second, we aim to prove this conjecture in the tame case for quasi-split unramified reductive groups. Finally, we will explore the first applications of such categorical equivalence.","authors":["Xinwen Zhu"],"year":"2025","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.07482","cluster":"representation_theory","macros":{"fraka":"{\\mathfrak a}","frakb":"{\\mathfrak b}","frakc":"{\\mathfrak c}","frakg":"{\\mathfrak g}","frakh":"{\\mathfrak h}","frakm":"{\\mathfrak m}","frakp":"{\\mathfrak p}","fraks":"{\\mathfrak s}","frakt":"{\\mathfrak t}","fraku":"{\\mathfrak u}","frakA":"{\\mathfrak A}","frakC":"{\\mathfrak C}","frakM":"{\\mathfrak M}","frakX":"{\\mathfrak X}","bA":"{\\mathbb A}","bB":"{\\mathbb B}","bC":"{\\mathbb C}","bD":"{\\mathbb D}","bF":"{\\mathbb F}","bG":"{\\mathbb G}","bL":"{\\mathbb L}","bN":"{\\mathbb N}","bO":"{\\mathbb O}","bP":"{\\mathbb P}","bQ":"{\\mathbb Q}","bR":"{\\mathbb R}","bT":"{\\mathbb T}","bX":"{\\mathbb X}","bZ":"{\\mathbb Z}","bfA":"{\\mathbf A}","bfB":"{\\mathbf B}","bfC":"{\\mathbf C}","bfD":"{\\mathbf D}","bfE":"{\\mathbf E}","bfF":"{\\mathbf F}","bfG":"{\\mathbf G}","bfH":"{\\mathbf H}","bfI":"{\\mathbf I}","bfK":"{\\mathbf K}","bfL":"{\\mathbf L}","bfM":"{\\mathbf M}","bfN":"{\\mathbf N}","bfP":"{\\mathbf P}","bfR":"{\\mathbf R}","bfS":"{\\mathbf S}","bfT":"{\\mathbf T}","bfa":"{\\mathbf a}","bff":"{\\mathbf f}","mA":"{\\mathcal A}","mB":"{\\mathcal B}","mE":"{\\mathcal E}","mF":"{\\mathcal F}","mG":"{\\mathcal G}","mH":"{\\mathcal H}","mI":"{\\mathcal I}","mJ":"{\\mathcal J}","mK":"{\\mathcal K}","mL":"{\\mathcal L}","mM":"{\\mathcal M}","mN":"{\\mathcal N}","mO":"{\\mathcal O}","mP":"{\\mathcal P}","mQ":"{\\mathcal Q}","mS":"{\\mathcal S}","mT":"{\\mathcal T}","mU":"{\\mathcal U}","mV":"{\\mathcal V}","mW":"{\\mathcal W}","mX":"{\\mathcal X}","mZ":"{\\mathcal Z}","scrA":"{\\mathscr A}","scrB":"{\\mathscr B}","scrS":"{\\mathscr S}","al":"{\\alpha}","ga":"{\\gamma}","Ga":"{\\Gamma}","la":"{\\lambda}","La":"{\\Lambda}","barcons":"\\mathrm{Bar}","cycl":"|| \\cdot ||","Sym":"\\mathrm{Sym}","ext":"\\mathrm{ext}","id":"\\mathrm{id}","pr":"\\mathrm{pr}","pt":"\\mathrm{pt}","bs":"\\b